OL,3,ABank of England holds interest rates at
OL,4,A3.75% despite rising inflation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bank of England has held interest
OL,7,Frates at 3.75%
OL,9,FSix members of the Monetary Policy
OL,10,FCommittee, which makes the decision,
OL,11,Fvoted to hold the rate, while the other
OL,12,Fthree wanted an increase to 4%
OL,14,FThe hold comes despite rising inflation
OL,15,F- the UK rate is 3.1%, well above the
OL,16,FBank's 2% target
OL,18,FIncreasing interest rates can slow down
OL,19,Finflation, by making borrowing
OL,20,F(including mortgages) more expensive
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
